      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/dspace-7-rest-contract/blocks/prose-s529-how-it-works",
      "source": "sections/s529-how-it-works.md",
      "source_hash": "30d3b06437a9c4074754d848dd01fd2addf54f70dc968a33492fe848c238b546",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "How the ORCID-bulk-push script works. It finds every entity in the ORCID queue and tries to synchronise each with ORCID. A failed entity is retried up to a maximum number of attempts, 10 by default and configurable in the ORCID configuration file. The -f option forces synchronisation even when that maximum has been reached.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt8n45nmwCHCTpc28EY"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-01"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/dspace-7-rest-contract/blocks/prose-s530-parameters",
      "source": "sections/s530-parameters.md",
      "source_hash": "a37a2c0822f6d0e6fb65922bc184b88040dedfd3338105039f1242674a0ebb95",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "The ORCID-bulk-push script has one parameter: -f/--force, which forces synchronisation and ignores the maximum number of attempts.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt8n45nmwCHCTpc28EY"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-01"
        }
      ]
    },
